  Description: You awakened when a bit of another person's life force and a fragment
    of their soul-possibly, but not always, at the moment of their death-found its
    way into your constructed body. You don't remember anything more than vague flashes
    of your "before life," but that life essence still protects you. You gain resistance
    to void damage equal to half your level (minimum 1).
